<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="detail-top"><button class="back" bindtap="back">‹</button><view class="detail-title">留一句给今天</view></view><view class="page-copy">这条记录默认只有你自己能看见。</view><view class="form-card"><view class="form-title">今天的风怎么样？</view><textarea class="field-textarea" placeholder="不用完整，也不用马上写。" value="{{body}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="chip-row"><block wx:for="{{moods}}" wx:key="*this"><button class="chip {{mood===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choose">{{item}}</button></block></view><button class="primary-btn" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存私密记录</button></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">JUST FOR ME</text><view class="section-heading">之前留下的</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{records.length}}"><block wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="record-card"><text>{{item.mood}} · 仅自己可见</text><b>{{item.body}}</b></view></block></block><view wx:else class="empty">还没有记录。<br/>等想留下一点什么的时候再写。</view></view></view>